    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/d10fbe33d7ddb16eca1ec048bd0461f0.avif?t=1754575405\" width=616 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/bbbf33ff9ff73f9a098a1e026a0429c2.poster.avif?t=1754575405\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/bbbf33ff9ff73f9a098a1e026a0429c2.webm?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/bbbf33ff9ff73f9a098a1e026a0429c2.mp4?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re part of a freshly deployed unit, hired to work night shifts for a mysterious military organization. Your mission: clear deadly mines obstructing a remote archaeological dig site in the middle of nowhere.<br>  <br>Your main goal is to disarm mines, plunder ruins or  scavenge whatever you can in order to secure enough funds to keep your unit afloat for the next day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/Features.png?t=1754575405\" width=616 height=266 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/837116a4642b435ad52349ebaf4ac6cc.poster.avif?t=1754575405\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/837116a4642b435ad52349ebaf4ac6cc.webm?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/837116a4642b435ad52349ebaf4ac6cc.mp4?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disarm mines</strong>. No two are ever the same. (<strong>There is an option for color blindness!</strong>).<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/f37c8cabb121dfa292788077c5f43ae5.poster.avif?t=1754575405\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/f37c8cabb121dfa292788077c5f43ae5.webm?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/f37c8cabb121dfa292788077c5f43ae5.mp4?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-4 Players</strong>. (Invite Only)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A non-linear, semi-open world</strong> filled with secrets to uncover and disasters of all kinds waiting to happen at any moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disarming mines is too relaxing, so there is also <strong>a large roster of entities</strong> that can stalk the world and hunt players in their own respective ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomly generated ruins</strong> lie beneath the world, waiting to be unearthed and looted. But beware\u2014terrible horrors may lurk inside.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity-based voice chat.</strong> Find and repair radio towers throughout the world to extend radio range for your unit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A player status system </strong>built to always keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An infinitely scaling game loop,</strong> with the option to complete the game\u2014if you can find the means to do so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/74cd3f22c3a8edad08933ebe53a08cb8.poster.avif?t=1754575405\" width=616 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/74cd3f22c3a8edad08933ebe53a08cb8.webm?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/74cd3f22c3a8edad08933ebe53a08cb8.mp4?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/d10fbe33d7ddb16eca1ec048bd0461f0.avif?t=1754575405\" width=616 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/bbbf33ff9ff73f9a098a1e026a0429c2.poster.avif?t=1754575405\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/bbbf33ff9ff73f9a098a1e026a0429c2.webm?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/bbbf33ff9ff73f9a098a1e026a0429c2.mp4?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re part of a freshly deployed unit, hired to work night shifts for a mysterious military organization. Your mission: clear deadly mines obstructing a remote archaeological dig site in the middle of nowhere.<br>  <br>Your main goal is to disarm mines, plunder ruins or  scavenge whatever you can in order to secure enough funds to keep your unit afloat for the next day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/Features.png?t=1754575405\" width=616 height=266 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/837116a4642b435ad52349ebaf4ac6cc.poster.avif?t=1754575405\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/837116a4642b435ad52349ebaf4ac6cc.webm?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/837116a4642b435ad52349ebaf4ac6cc.mp4?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disarm mines</strong>. No two are ever the same. (<strong>There is an option for color blindness!</strong>).<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/f37c8cabb121dfa292788077c5f43ae5.poster.avif?t=1754575405\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/f37c8cabb121dfa292788077c5f43ae5.webm?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/f37c8cabb121dfa292788077c5f43ae5.mp4?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-4 Players</strong>. (Invite Only)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A non-linear, semi-open world</strong> filled with secrets to uncover and disasters of all kinds waiting to happen at any moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disarming mines is too relaxing, so there is also <strong>a large roster of entities</strong> that can stalk the world and hunt players in their own respective ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomly generated ruins</strong> lie beneath the world, waiting to be unearthed and looted. But beware\u2014terrible horrors may lurk inside.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity-based voice chat.</strong> Find and repair radio towers throughout the world to extend radio range for your unit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A player status system </strong>built to always keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An infinitely scaling game loop,</strong> with the option to complete the game\u2014if you can find the means to do so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/74cd3f22c3a8edad08933ebe53a08cb8.poster.avif?t=1754575405\" width=616 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/74cd3f22c3a8edad08933ebe53a08cb8.webm?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/extras/74cd3f22c3a8edad08933ebe53a08cb8.mp4?t=1754575405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Demining is a 1\u20134 player, semi\u2013open world horror experience where every step could be your last. Work together or alone to disarm deadly mines and explore mysterious ruins in an increasingly perilous world.",
